@startuml
title Requirements Engineering System Context

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Primary User" as User
rectangle "Gmail Provider" as Gmail
rectangle "Telegram Provider" as Telegram
rectangle "Background Sync Trigger" as Sync
rectangle "OmniDesk" as System

User --> System : authentication and workspace actions
Gmail <--> System : connection and communication data
Telegram <--> System : connection and communication data
Sync --> System : synchronization trigger
System --> User : messages, status, and results
@enduml